### 1. Login (Get your token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/merchants/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@capetowncoffee.com",
  "password": "supersecretpassword"
}

### 2. Try to create invoice WITHOUT token (Expect 401 Access Denied)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "items": [
    { "name": "Hacker Coffee", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 0.01 }
  ]
}

### 3. Create invoice WITH token (Expect 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2Zjc1ZTdjMC01NzNlLTQ3ZGMtODlkNi02MWQ1MThkZTIxNWYiLCJtZXJjaGFudElkIjoiNmMxNmRiMWQtNTQ3Ni00ODY4LTk1NGUtZjE1Y2I2NjgwODhiIiwicm9sZSI6Ik1FUkNIQU5UIiwiaWF0IjoxNzk0MzA5NDY3LCJleHAiOjE3OTQzOTU4Njd9.pjD8BAyIhwqz-hd33fQp0BupsiG1FGSovTw2CE-oZ6w

{
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "items": [
    { "name": "Espresso", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 25.00 }
