### 4. Request Payment (Simulate Scanning QR)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/x402/pay/d9ff1d30-a625-4381-bff0-cf73b97f70d7

### 5. Settle Payment (Authenticated fallback - requires valid 32-byte 0x txHash)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/x402/settle/d9ff1d30-a625-4381-bff0-cf73b97f70d7
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "txHash": "0xabc1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abc"
}

### 6. Merchant Approves Reversal
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/v1/reversals/<REVERSAL_ID>
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <MERCHANT_JWT_TOKEN>

{
  "action": "APPROVE"
}

### 7. Merchant Ledger Summary
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/merchants/me/ledger
Authorization: Bearer <MERCHANT_JWT_TOKEN>